/-
# `Kant.Moonshine` — the coordinate system

A rebuild of the old `erdfa:`/`dasl:` addressing block as five layers that
cannot be mistaken for one another:

| Module | Layer | Headline |
|---|---|---|
| `Kant.Moonshine.Crt` | placement | a declared modulus system; the triple *is* the class (CRT), and a class cannot determine content |
| `Kant.Moonshine.Degrees` | representation degrees | 194 irreducible indices, degree derived from index, prime support derived from degree; degree is not an identifier |
| `Kant.Moonshine.Address` | identity display | the canonical 64-bit layout `magic ‖ class ‖ type ‖ digest prefix`, parser and renderer mutually inverse — and not an identity |
| `Kant.Moonshine.RepRing` | representation data | the free ℤ-module on 194 generators, fusion carried as a hypothesis, exact truncated q-series |
| `Kant.Moonshine.Trace` | evaluation witness | a replayable trace, a value that cannot be forged, and placement *by value* — π sits at its own digits |
| `Kant.Moonshine.Shadow` | evidence | typed distances that carry their own laws; at most three landmarks; a candidate region, never a reconstruction |
| `Kant.Moonshine.Record` | the record | one identity, typed metadata, derived coordinates; anchor bound and witness threshold are separate counts |
| `Kant.Moonshine.Exchange` | transport | a catalogue element as a paste that round-trips, and the RDFa block rendered from that same record |
| `Kant.Moonshine.Demo` | worked examples | `#guard`-checked vectors for the whole pipeline |
-/
